<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hong Kong government ratings affirmed by S&amp;P.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hong Kong government ratings affirmed by S&amp;P.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Wednesday it had affirmed the &quot;A&quot; rating of the foreign currency debt of the Hong Kong government and said the outlook for the long term ratings remained positive.</p>
</text>
